 "description": "Compare two network snapshots (from snapshot_td_graph) and return a readable diff: which nodes were added or removed, which connections changed, and which parameters changed (with before/after values). Snapshot before an edit and after to see exactly what changed, or to version a patch over time. Pure analysis \u2014 touches nothing in TouchDesigner.",
